<title>USA: Transatlantic Q4 shr $1.80 vs $1.50.</title>
<headline>Transatlantic Q4 shr $1.80 vs $1.50.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transatlantic Holdings, Inc. and Subsidiaries</p>
<p>				     Financial Highlights</p>
<p>			  (in millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>					     Twelve Months Ended Dec 31</p>
<p>						1996	 1995     Change</p>
<p>   Net income, as reported	  $154.9     $131.9     17.4%</p>
<p>   Income, as adjusted (A)	  $142.7     $124.6     14.5%</p>
<p>PER COMMON SHARE RESULTS:</p>
<p>   Net income, as reported	   $6.74	$5.75     17.2%</p>
<p>   Income, as adjusted (A)	   $6.21	$5.43     14.3%</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>     shares outstanding		 23.0	 22.9</p>
<p>						  Fourth Quarter</p>
<p>						 1996	 1995    Change</p>
<p>   Net income, as reported	   $41.3	$34.3     20.5%</p>
<p>   Income, as adjusted (A)	   $37.9	$32.3     17.4%</p>
<p>PER COMMON SHARE RESULTS:</p>
<p>   Net income, as reported	   $1.80	$1.50     20.2%</p>
<p>   Income, as adjusted (A)	   $1.65	$1.40     17.1%</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>     shares outstanding		 23.0	 22.9</p>
<p>NOTE: (A) Represents net income less realized capital gains, net of income taxes.</p>
<p>Income before income taxes increased 19.9 percent to $196.3 million in 1996 year versus $163.8 million in 1995. Included in these results are pre-tax realized capital gains of $18.7 million and $11.1 million in 1996 and 1995, respectively.</p>
<p>Included in Q4 1996 results are pre-tax realized capital gains of $5.3 million and $3.1 million in 1996 and 1995, respectively.</p>
</text>
